## 4. Investment Thesis & Peer Comparison
### Core Thesis:
Intel faces structural challenges in its core CPU business, with intensifying competition from AMD and NVIDIA. While it has a strong ecosystem in AI and cloud, execution issues and financial struggles weigh on its prospects.  

### Bull Case:
Intel’s undervaluation and potential recovery in data center demand could drive upside. Its ecosystem strength in AI and cloud computing offers long-term growth opportunities.  

### Bear Case:
Weak financials, negative FCF, and high competition make Intel vulnerable to further declines. Its reliance on foundries and inventory issues add to operational risks.  

### Verdict: PASS — Avoid  

